ket prices instantly so you always know what your cards are worth.\n\nOrganize Your Collection\nBuild portfolios, track duplicates, and create wishlists. Your digital collection stays synced and accessible anywhere.\n\nSecure Cloud Backup\nYour collection is safe and available across all devices. Never lose track of a card again.\n\nWhether you're a casual fan or serious collector, HoloDex helps you stay organized, protect value, and make smarter trading decisions, across all your favorite TCGs.\n\nKey Features\n\n- Multi-TCG support: Pokémon, One Piece, Lorcana, Yu-Gi-Oh!, and Magic: The Gathering\n- AI card scanner with instant recognition\n- AI grading insights for card condition\n- Real-time market price tracking\n- Portfolio and collection management\n- Wishlist tracking\n- Multi-device sync\n- Multi-currency support\n- Track profits and losses\n\n\nIn-App Purchases Unlock:\n- Unlimited card scans\n- Exclusive filters\n- AI Grading\n\nBuilt for collectors. Backed by data.\n\nStart scanning your cards today with HoloDex\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "userRatingCount": 112}]}